{"id":"n15760-3-7","stage":3,"title":"미루다 · 推想","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15760-3-7-1","ko":"이 사진은 언제 찍은 걸까?","zh":"这张照片是什么时候拍的呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사진은","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"언제","meaning":"什么时候","explanation":"언제：什么时候","readings":[{"term":"언제","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17860","senseId":"1","lemma":"언제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찍은","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"걸까?","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"25f9ca42793d0a69","term":"언제","zh":"什么时候","audio":"/audio/25f9ca42793d0a69dee9.mp3","entryId":"17860","definition":"不知道的某时。","pronunciation":["언ː제"]},{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/dff9cedfd49cd2239533.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15760-3-7-2","ko":"사람들의 옷차림으로 미루어 보면 여름인 것 같아.","zh":"从大家穿的衣服来看，应该是夏天吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사람들의","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"옷차림으로","meaning":"穿着，衣着，打扮","explanation":"옷차림：穿着，衣着，打扮；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"옷차림","audio":"/audio/e62aaa39b90c8025908d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22144","senseId":"1","lemma":"옷차림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미루어","meaning":"推想，推测","explanation":"미루다：推想，推测；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"미루다","audio":"/audio/c56b12cde62f415abd7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15760","senseId":"3","lemma":"미루다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보면","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여름인","meaning":"夏，夏天，夏季","explanation":"여름：夏，夏天，夏季；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"여름","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67701","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"(贬称)人或动物。","explanation":"것：(贬称)人或动物。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"2","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人们，大家","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"对没有特别指定的，自己以外的人的称呼。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"e62aaa39b90c8025","term":"옷차림","zh":"穿着，衣着，打扮","audio":"/audio/e62aaa39b90c8025908d.mp3","entryId":"22144","definition":"穿着衣服的样子。","pronunciation":["옫차림"]},{"id":"c56b12cde62f415a","term":"미루다","zh":"推想，推测","audio":"/audio/c56b12cde62f415abd7b.mp3","entryId":"15760","definition":"用已知事实提前猜测其他事宜。","pronunciation":["미루다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"4442e49ca3d7c1ba","term":"여름","zh":"夏，夏天，夏季","audio":"/audio/4442e49ca3d7c1ba77c7.mp3","entryId":"67701","definition":"四季之一，介于春秋之间的季节。","pronunciation":["여름"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"(贬称)人或动物。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"(贬称)人或动物。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/8b75f30de58235f8e238.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.817,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15760","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":92,"sequenceScore":2.4704,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这张照片是什么时候拍的呀？","从大家穿的衣服来看，应该是夏天吧。","你想用这个盒子做什么？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这张照片是什么时候拍的呀？","从大家穿的衣服来看，应该是夏天吧。","你想用这个盒子做什么？"],"answer":1}]}
